Robert Downey Jr.'s perks on the set of *Avengers: Doctor Doom* have been revealed—and they’re next-level.

Included in his deal:
• A private trailer compound, reserved exclusively for him;  
• Creative input on the script and the freedom to rework his lines;  
• A luxury custom-built motorhome for downtime between shoots;  
• An armored SUV with a personal driver;  
• Private screenings of edited footage to provide feedback;  
• A full convoy of trailers and a private zone on set dubbed “Downey Land”;  
• A share of the box office revenue as a bonus;  
• A base salary of $80 million.

The man truly lives his golden era.  

